
# 2026-09-09 11:43:53.496669
+Make ONE small safety improvement in overnight/self_improver.py only.
+
+Add a helper named _has_sufficient_disk_space() using shutil.disk_usage(ROOT) or the existing repository root path.
+
+The helper must:
+- return True when at least 2 GiB of free space is available;
+- return False when less than 2 GiB is available;
+- fail closed if disk_usage raises an exception;
+- have a small clear docstring.
+
+Then make apply_auto_fix() call this helper near the beginning, before expensive generation or mutation work. If insufficient space, return False without modifying repository files.
+
+Do not change any other behavior.
+Do not change the existing safety gates.
+Do not change canary behavior.
+Do not change Git behavior.
+Do not modify any other source file.
+Do not create tests; the test file is already supplied.
+Do not commit anything.

